item.description:
In an October 28 post, CENTCOM dismissed Iranian media reports that commercial vessels are striking sea mines in the Strait of Hormuz, saying all internationally recognized primary transit routes have been cleared of mines by US forces and remain so, and that thousands of vessels continue to pass safely.

That directly contradicts Iran's army claim Tuesday that a tanker running dark hit mines and caught fire east of the strait — the two sides' accounts of the waterway are now in open dispute, days before Iran's threatened November 1 "legal action" against Sinokor tankers. Sources: Life News Agency/CENTCOM, October 28;

Source: lifenewsagency.com.

GitHub's multi-model coding agent system — which auto-selects models per task — went GA on October 28, with GitHub claiming its Max setting scored within two points of Claude Code with Opus 5.5 Max on the Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index at about half the average API cost per task.

Copilot Projects also entered public preview in the Copilot app, running agent work across multiple repos. Sources: Unite.AI, October 28;

Source: unite.ai.

The Brotli flaw CVE-2026-111497 (CVSS 9.2, also called Node2Shell) joined CISA's exploited list on Tuesday, as reported in the night brief — and by Wednesday morning, security firms including Previdian reported exploitation attempts hitting their honeypots, with fixes already out from Node.js, Google, Microsoft (.NET), Bun, Envoy and Istio, and Palo Alto rolling out PAN-OS hotfixes.

If you run anything on Brotli 1.0.3–1.2.0, this is no longer a theoretical patch. Sources: The Hacker News, October 28;

Source: thehackernews.com.

The Verkhovna Rada voted Monday to extend martial law and general mobilization for another 90 days, taking effect October 31 — 293 votes for martial law, 281 for mobilization.

It is the latest in a series of extensions running since February 2022. Sources: Visit Ukraine, October 26;

Source: visitukraine.today.

Reuters reports the Houthis said Tuesday they attacked Saudi Arabia's Ras Tanura refinery, the kingdom's biggest, on the Gulf; no damage confirmation is in the reporting checked.

Separately, the Saudi-led coalition said it intercepted three ballistic missiles aimed at the Eastern Region and four drones aimed at the Southern Region, with civil defence alerts in the Eastern Region and Kharj governorate later lifted. Source: Reuters, October 27;

Source: reuters.com.
